.TH CTX 1 "Context" "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
context \- Rust POSIX shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ctx
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Context
is a POSIX-compatible shell designed for high performance,
extensibility, and deep customization. It aims to be a drop-in replacement for
traditional shells while providing modern features, a rich builtin set, and
first-class plugin support.
.PP
Context combines the speed and memory safety with a familiar
command-line interface, making it suitable for interactive use, scripting, and
embedded environments.
